<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-England 203-3 at lunch, needing 102 more.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-England 203-3 at lunch, needing 102 more.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1996-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 203 for three wickets at lunch on the fifth and last day on Tuesday in their quest for 305 to beat New Zealand in the third and final test.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 346 and 186.</p>
<p>England 228 and 203 for three wickets (M. Atherton 105 not out).</p>
</text>
